<title>UK: CREDIT LYONNAIS SETS WARRANTS ON CHINA MOTOR CO.</title>
<headline>CREDIT LYONNAIS SETS WARRANTS ON CHINA MOTOR CO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued five million European-style call warrants on shares of China Motor Co Ltd, lead manager Credit Lyonais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$70		     PREMIUM	15.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$10.92		  GEARING	6.4 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.AUG.97-28.JAN.98   PAYDATE	06.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   UNLISTED		  MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
